1
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:36,630
Who is that kicking Hei Wuya so hard?

2
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,600
His name is Huo Yi.

3
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,300
He's my best friend.

4
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:44,530
Bai,

5
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,260
who hurt you like this?

6
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:48,400
Qiongqi.

7
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,130
No,

8
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,620
it was Feng Qingwu.

9
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,000
Qiongqi went berserk
because she controlled him.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,800
Huo Yi,

11
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:55,930
here.

12
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,130
Throw Hei Wuya down the cold pool.

13
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,300
Tell that guy

14
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,400
that Hei Wuya injured Bai,

15
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,260
and he can do whatever he wants with him.

16
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,060
The cold pool.

17
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,800
Finally,

18
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:08,260
a chance.

19
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,560
Ever since I saw that eye,

20
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:13,800
I knew there must be a secret
at the bottom of the cold pool.

21
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:16,400
Uncle, you finally let it slip.

22
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,130
There really is something fishy
at the bottom of the cold pool.

23
00:01:18,130 --> 00:01:19,730
I want you to take me to see it.

24
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,860
There's actually a stone door here.

25
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,830
Stop hitting me!

26
00:02:01,060 --> 00:02:03,300
I really didn't hurt Bai!

27
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:04,900
Still trying to argue?

28
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:06,330
I'll beat you to death!

29
00:02:15,730 --> 00:02:16,530
Tengshe,

30
00:02:18,829 --> 00:02:19,560
you brat,

31
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,130
you still dare to come down and find me?

32
00:02:21,130 --> 00:02:22,260
How is Bai doing now?

33
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,500
Why does my heart hurt so much

34
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,829
when I see this Tengshe?

35
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:32,560
I had a strange feeling

36
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,600
when I saw Chilian back then too.

37
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:37,060
Could my background

38
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:38,260
be related to snakes?

39
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,030
Girl,

40
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:44,360
what's wrong?

41
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:46,030
It hurts.

42
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,160
My heart hurts so much.

43
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:55,829
Answer me,

44
00:02:56,230 --> 00:02:57,360
how is Bai?

45
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,400
He's fine.

46
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:01,990
You don't need to worry.

47
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:04,360
As for this Hei Wuya,

48
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,430
consider him a toy for you.

49
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,500
Just don't play him to death.

50
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,460
I have things to do, I'm leaving.

51
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,100
Who is she?

52
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,630
What is that brat doing?

53
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:24,329
Feng,

54
00:03:24,930 --> 00:03:26,260
lock her in the dungeon.

55
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:29,090
Send her to Qilin Mountain
on a chosen day.

56
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,860
Master Wu, please.

57
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:36,560
Since you are one of
the Ten Masters of Yanmen,

58
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,230
I won't put shackles on you.

59
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,960
It's all this wild girl's fault.

60
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:43,260
Let me go! I'm going to kill her!

61
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:51,900
Madam, I'm sorry.

62
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,030
You can punish me however you want.

63
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:54,829
Oh, no, no, no.

64
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,829
Feng Qingwu controlled you.

65
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:59,020
I believe Bai won't blame you either.

66
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:01,520
Now is not the time to talk about this.

67
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:05,600
Sect Leader, we are in a mess ourselves.

68
00:04:05,730 --> 00:04:09,790
It would be terrible if the Demonic Cult
took advantage of the situation.

69
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:14,400
And with the current situation,

70
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,730
our enemies are not only the Demonic Cult.

71
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:21,430
Alliance.

72
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:24,860
These days,

73
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:27,530
I've learned a lot
about the outside world.

74
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:29,800
If Yanmen, Buerkai,

75
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,159
and Sanzangwu can form an alliance,

76
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:35,460
the Demonic Cult won't dare
to cause trouble again.

77
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,630
But we don't have any ties with Buerkai.

78
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:46,860
Nor with Sanzangwu.

79
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:52,230
Okay,

80
00:04:52,230 --> 00:04:53,200
girl.

81
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,659
Take Huo Yi and Qiong Qi
to facilitate the alliance.

82
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,630
Three days.

83
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,760
If the alliance isn't formed
within three days,

84
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,700
I will go find Yu Qitian myself.

85
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:07,430
Understood.

86
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,500
My Lady,

87
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,730
this is where Bu'erkai is hidden.

88
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:19,800
My Lady,

89
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,660
why do you look so unhappy?

90
00:05:22,730 --> 00:05:24,800
Uncle only gave us three days.

91
00:05:25,030 --> 00:05:26,600
But right now,
I don't even know where Yu Qitian,

92
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,130
the leader of Bu'erkai, is.

93
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,760
You don't need to worry about that,
My Lady.

94
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,930
I can find him.

95
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:47,400
Who goes there?

96
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,659
I am A'kong.

97
00:05:53,730 --> 00:05:55,230
Is this Yu Qitian?

98
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,060
No,

99
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,060
this is Jiao Tu,

100
00:05:58,230 --> 00:05:59,830
the accountant of Bu'erkai.

101
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:02,560
The real Yu Qitian

102
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:05,830
is behind this screen.

103
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,160
A'kong.
